 his medical knowledge! Now my life is changing in ways I never expected, but is this a blessing… or a curse?\n\n---\n\n- [Original Webtoon <Webtoon kakao>](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EB%8B%A5%ED%84%B0-%EC%B5%9C%ED%83%9C%EC%88%98/2310)\n\n---\n\n- [Official Traditional Chinese Translation](https://tw.kakaowebtoon.com/content/%E7%A5%9E%E9%86%AB%E5%B4%94%E6%B3%B0%E7%A7%80/123)\n\n- [Official Japanese Translation](https://piccoma.com/web/product/70671)\n\n- [Official Thai Translation](https://th.kakaowebtoon.com/content/%E0%B8%84%E0%B8%B8%E0%B8%93%E0%B8%AB%E0%B8%A1%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%8A%E0%B9%80%E0%B8%A7%E0%B9%81%E0%B8%97%E0%B8%8B%E0%B8%B9/214)","year":2017,"status":"ongoing","lastChapter":null,"contentRating":"safe","tags":["Action","Psychological","Drama","Medical","Fantasy","Slice of Life"],"poster":"https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/fe3335b6-883e-4e42-bd83-35ea16fc4605/61d1ae33-0782-4f94-8b9f-8deb68e68dca.jpg.512.jpg","originalLanguage":"ko","availableLanguages":["en","es-la"],"lane":"manhwa","rating":7.82,"follows":762,"listAt":"2026-10-19T10:36:54.195Z","chapters":[{"id":"3f6785b0-1117-4274-9471-34d1b06c3900","number":"130","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":56,"createdAt":"2022-07-28T10:52:32+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"50bf87a0-bf25-4413-9b5b-88f5ed53abac","number":"129","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":60,"createdAt":"2022-07-28T10:47:44+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"7ae28bc9-a956-4836-a16b-0f12bb373b86","number":"128","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":63,"createdAt":"2022-07-28T10:43:35+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"6e6b4014-cfe0-4f6f-87b7-75f37cb65265","number":"127","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":57,"createdAt":"2022-07-28T10:41:20+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"b7bf6088-8957-4b37-ab36-34db8c7c0379","number":"126","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":55,"createdAt":"2022-07-28T10:08:55+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"307ec999-8350-4935-8876-a170c303f309","number":"125","volume":null,"title":nu